  "published": "2026-09-26T02:15:49.067Z",
  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.1-alpha - The first release, a prerelease. 32 nodes in eight categories - Mapsui,\n      Mapsui.Layers, Mapsui.Styles, Mapsui.Navigate, Mapsui.Project, Mapsui.Widgets, Mapsui.Skia,\n      Mapsui.Debug - 244 tests, 19 help patches, and F1 on every node opens one. Tile layers\n      (OpenStreetMap, any XYZ service) with a shared disk cache, geometry and feature layers, a\n      graticule, five styles, navigation, picking, pixel/degree conversion and widgets. Wraps\n      Mapsui 4.1.9; verified in vvvv gamma 7.4. Fetching is off until you switch it on. Not ready\n      for real work: the node surface may still change between prereleases.",
